        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"6d8f7d1f-54aa-4ec1-b02c-805002951c14\",\"review_text\":\"Too many commercials.\"},{\"review_id\":\"f7bbd417-2c54-4886-a588-e10a196e377f\",\"review_text\":\"I dont like this appp .\"},{\"review_id\":\"a09a14f2-bc99-4a30-8eb4-ec3622b38e59\",\"review_text\":\"G bbye\"},{\"review_id\":\"c0bea2ab-2c28-4005-bb13-9937ee1b9ce2\",\"review_text\":\"Bycottt\"},{\"review_id\":\"ebbd7655-269b-496a-8f80-062c6b8799d9\",\"review_text\":\"Very good 💯 app\"},{\"review_id\":\"1ca9d2e1-610f-4876-916b-1326b186d7f0\",\"review_text\":\"Worst music app honestly. Keeps logging me out almost everyday.\"},{\"review_id\":\"f9840d5a-e056-45ef-b63d-1c423eb71a54\",\"review_text\":\"This is the best audio app I've used so far, and I've used many So many good recommendations :)\"},{\"review_id\":\"f9203d5d-a629-46b0-b066-804892244365\",\"review_text\":\"Good app, horrible optimisation and lies. When it comes to Spotify, you don't get 30 minutes of uninterrupted listening and many have also experienced this along with 3 60 second ads in a row. On another hand, some songs refuse to play, even on wifi or if you have them downloaded, this is a big bug that needs to get fixed. I force restarted Spotify several times to get it to just work sometimes with no results. It has great selection but is just not worth it.\"},{\"review_id\":\"8b79fbc7-5b97-4dc9-835c-2000c1f18f4d\",\"review_text\":\"Now this app is getting excited with worst you can play song in order,can play fav part by skipping other part of song, for basic thing we need to buy premium boycott this appk\"},{\"review_id\":\"de8102c6-7d6a-45c4-989e-264b509c9b34\",\"review_text\":\"Best Playlist\"}]}"
